{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50642","headline":"在边亭赋得山花戏寄两领客使并滋三 · 王孝廉","name":"在边亭赋得山花戏寄两领客使并滋三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳树春色（疑应作花）色甚明，初开似笑听无声。\n主人每日专攀尽，残片何时赠客情？\n（同前。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王孝廉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50642.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50642","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}